Title: Kirsty Maclean: Liverpool sign Scotland midfielder from Rangers
Date: 2025-07-14
Firsthand information: {'Speaker': [{'Speaker': 'Kirsty Maclean', 'Text': 'The Rangers academy product, who made over 100 appearances for the Glasgow club, said it was the "right time for a new challenge and to take the next step".', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 2, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 117}}, {'Speaker': 'Kirsty Maclean', 'Text': 'She said: "I think the club speaks for itself. It\'s obviously a massive club with a lot of history and to be able to represent the badge is a really proud moment for me.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 4, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 155}}, {'Speaker': 'Kirsty Maclean', 'Text': '"I\'m a midfielder who likes to be on the ball and tries to make things happen so hopefully I can link up with the players in front of me and we can try to score lots of goals this season."', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 5, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 166}}], 'Description': [{'Description': 'Liverpool have signed 20-year-old Scotland midfielder Kirsty Maclean from Rangers.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 1, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 68}}], 'Image': [{'ID': 'image_1', 'Caption': 'Kirsty Maclean playing for Scotland'}]}
